    "controller_support": "full",
    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/adcc5282ced829de4241cf87be8dd336.poster.avif?t=1754929747\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/adcc5282ced829de4241cf87be8dd336.webm?t=1754929747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/adcc5282ced829de4241cf87be8dd336.mp4?t=1754929747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/dd388567c9305f587144d0937930923e.webp?t=1754929747\" data-has-big width=800 height=6 /></span>Discover <strong>pinball</strong> like never before with Appulse! The game is <strong>a roguelite shooter,</strong> where you protect a Galactic Federation ship! Upgrade your ball, your weapons and your ship to pushback waves of unwavering robots.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/12e69e381fddd264f0a66eccfccb413e.poster.avif?t=1754929747\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/12e69e381fddd264f0a66eccfccb413e.webm?t=1754929747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/12e69e381fddd264f0a66eccfccb413e.mp4?t=1754929747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/6bdf9efc2304fb57602a53501192677e.webp?t=1754929747\" data-has-big width=800 height=25 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/dd388567c9305f587144d0937930923e.webp?t=1754929747\" data-has-big width=800 height=6 /></span>Inspired by the <strong>classic pinball Space Cadet</strong> we loved during our childhood, Appulse is a reinterpretation of the genre. Bringing newcomers and old timers by mixing <strong>the juicy mechanics of the pinball</strong>, and the thrilling and <strong>fast</strong> <strong>gameplay of a roguelite shooter</strong>, we want to spark a new interest among the gamer community!</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > </p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >We stayed faithful to the pinball legacy and designed a completely <strong>unique table</strong> for Appulse. In this game you are entirely immersed into a space war. Your goal is to <strong>protect the capital    </strong><br><br><strong>ship</strong> while he is cruising through space to escape the grasp of the robot syndicate.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/1b0e9deee4904383df00e6a2992a05da.poster.avif?t=1754929747\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/1b0e9deee4904383df00e6a2992a05da.webm?t=1754929747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/1b0e9deee4904383df00e6a2992a05da.mp4?t=1754929747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/f181318f2dd54e5cb59fb771c4d4c420.webp?t=1754929747\" data-has-big width=800 height=25 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/dd388567c9305f587144d0937930923e.webp?t=1754929747\" data-has-big width=800 height=6 /></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Attack is the best form of defence!  <br>Jump on enemies spaceships using <strong>your cannon</strong>. Challenges and special events await you in these unknown territories. <strong>Conquer ships</strong> to add them to <strong>your fleet</strong> and win the war.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/021cadd0b36d3f0c8baea6f6d6396d4e.poster.avif?t=1754929747\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/021cadd0b36d3f0c8baea6f6d6396d4e.webm?t=1754929747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/021cadd0b36d3f0c8baea6f6d6396d4e.mp4?t=1754929747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/6dca5c4965ceeed41a15fd930e7e1a25.webp?t=1754929747\" data-has-big width=800 height=25 /></span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/dd388567c9305f587144d0937930923e.webp?t=1754929747\" data-has-big width=800 height=6 /></span>  Do not worry, you are bringing <strong>your own arsenal</strong> to face the trouble!     <br><strong>Pick the weapon</strong> of your choice to destroy the tripods trying to destroy your ship. The twist to the way you play a regular pinball, is that you will be able to control your ball thanks <strong>to recoil when firing.</strong> Master this technique and you will be capable to go anywhere you want!    <br>\u00a0<span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/12c230ac588455922a24b12352d10745.poster.avif?t=1754929747\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/12c230ac588455922a24b12352d10745.webm?t=1754929747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/12c230ac588455922a24b12352d10745.mp4?t=1754929747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Guns are not the only cards in your sleeve. Along the way you will <strong>power up your character</strong> thanks to special perks. Need more recoil when firing? Turrets to assist you in the ship's defense ? Or maybe the ability to slow down time to do the perfect action? You have the cards in your hands to create the perfect build!  <br> But be aware, they are all randomized, so you are guaranteed to have a unique run each time you put a coin in the machine.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" > <br> <span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/854624b913c1e78ad7b2873717beb54d.poster.avif?t=1754929747\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/854624b913c1e78ad7b2873717beb54d.webm?t=1754929747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/854624b913c1e78ad7b2873717beb54d.mp4?t=1754929747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span><strong>Use your flipper with precision, craft your own build, defeat your foes and master the scoreboard!</strong></p>",
    "about_the_game": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/adcc5282ced829de4241cf87be8dd336.poster.avif?t=1754929747\" width=800 height=304 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/adcc5282ced829de4241cf87be8dd336.webm?t=1754929747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/adcc5282ced829de4241cf87be8dd336.mp4?t=1754929747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/dd388567c9305f587144d0937930923e.webp?t=1754929747\" data-has-big width=800 height=6 /></span>Discover <strong>pinball</strong> like never before with Appulse! The game is <strong>a roguelite shooter,</strong> where you protect a Galactic Federation ship! Upgrade your ball, your weapons and your ship to pushback waves of unwavering robots.<br><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/12e69e381fddd264f0a66eccfccb413e.poster.avif?t=1754929747\" width=600 height=200 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/12e69e381fddd264f0a66eccfccb413e.webm?t=1754929747\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/12e69e381fddd264f0a66eccfccb413e.mp4?t=1754929747\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3498700/extras/